direction: right
inspect: "Inspect repository + installed APIs\nIdentify relevant knowledge bases/skills"
plan: "Acceptance contract + plan\nScope, risks, concrete checks"
pressure: "Pressure-test plan\nVerify checks detect failure"
slice: "Runnable vertical slice"
build: "Implement features + regression tests\nMark progress per step"
verify: "Run checks against source fingerprint\nRecord exit status + output tail"
review: "Adversarial review\nInteraction + visual + failure paths"
repair: "Repair failures (bounded)\nFailing check + quoted output tail"
adjust: "Adjust plan on wrong assumptions\nUpdate steps/checks to match reality"
deliver: "Evidence + launch instructions\nExplicit limitations"
inspect -> plan -> pressure -> slice -> build -> verify -> review -> deliver
verify -> repair: failed / stale
repair -> verify
build -> adjust: wrong assumption
adjust -> plan: revise contract
review -> repair: defect
